-- Case Craft: add 43 ready-made designs from public/phoneCases/Printed.
--
-- Run in Supabase → SQL Editor. Safe to run more than once: a design whose
-- image is already in the store is skipped.
--
-- Before running:
--   1. Set the price below (Rs, the SELLER price before Wishdrop's margin —
--      same as a price typed in the seller portal). One price for all 43;
--      change single designs afterwards in the seller portal.
--   2. The images must be at public/phoneCases/Printed/case-001.png … on the
--      live site. Folder names are case-sensitive on the server: the zip's
--      folder is "Printed" — rename it to "printed", or change the path below.
--
-- All designs: Tough Case series, every phone model on sale (models = empty),
-- marked New, active, in the order of their file numbers.
-- case-019 is left out: it's the same design as case-015 (Forget-Me-Not).

with params as (
  select 1500: :numeric as price            -- ← set the price here
),
store as (
  select id as seller_id from public.sellers where platform_slug = 'case-craft'
),
designs (sort, name, subtitle, image_url) as (
